"\n\n\n\n\n## Review\nVisited because it's renowned as one of Melbourne's top 3 coffees.  \nAs expected, there was quite a queue given its popularity.\n\nI thought the crowd would mean a long wait, but the line moved faster than expected and I was able to order in no time.\n\nWhen I ordered a Long Black and asked for a medium size, the staff kindly let me know that's called a Long Long Black.  \nThey ask for your name when you order, then call it out when your coffee is ready outside.  \nWhile waiting, they also handed out a glass of water each.\n\n\n\nBeing a weekday, most people seemed to be office workers grabbing takeout on their way to work.\n\nI'm not sure it was noticeably better than other places, but as always, Australian coffee delivered wherever I went.  \n## Pictures\n\n\n\n"